# .rtbrc — review-toolbox source registry for the GRUB2 MR review project.
# Read by `rtb` (~/.claude/skills/review-toolbox/rtb). Only variable assignments
# are read out of this file; no logic runs. Paths are relative to the repo root
# (the cwd during reviews), so this works identically on the host and in the
# review container (/grub-devel), where grub/ sits at ./grub either way.

# The grub repo: all MR branches as local `prNN` (and historical YYYY-MM-NNNN).
# READ-ONLY. New MRs are based on origin/master (rebased); pass --ref prNN per
# review, or a range to `rtb diff` (e.g. --ref origin/master..prNN).
SRC_grub_KIND=git
SRC_grub_PATH=./grub
SRC_grub_REF=origin/master

RTB_DEFAULT_SRC=grub
RTB_FACTS=./FACTS.md
